  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact 23-0002302 Technical Assistance to the Government for the Preparation of the Implementation of the New Indonesian Criminal Code</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact 23-0002302 This project supports the Indonesian government to create implementation guidelines to the newly passed Criminal Code (Law No.1/2023). This project also provides an avenue for civil society partners to provide input to the implementation, through direct engagement with the government and leading the process of learning from the Dutch experience, as well as making sure there is better protection of human rights. The project focuses on two elements (of 624 articles covered in the criminal code): criminal legislation and alternative sanctions.</narrative>
  </description>
